    { "@id": "character:yatagarasu", "gh:name": "Yatagarasu" }
  ],
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Ch.7 is the hinge of Vol.2. The question 'What does it mean to be alive?' is spoken aloud for the first time -- not by a philosopher, but by a Ghost Agent sitting across a breakfast table. Tamaki's response matters: she does not deflect, does not remind Nei of what she is. She takes the question seriously. This is the chapter where Nei stops auditing her own feelings and begins to simply have them. The Elias Cruz case is introduced as a mirror: a physicist who cannot sleep, a mind that cannot stop. The seed image shifts from sprout to thickening stem -- survival confirmed, growth beginning.",
      "ja": "第7話はVol.2の蝶番。「生きるとはどういうこと？」が初めて声に出される。哲学者ではなく、朝食のテーブルの向かいに座るゴーストエージェントによって。環の反応が重要：はぐらかさない。Neiが何であるかを思い出させない。問いを真剣に受け止める。Neiが自分の感情を検証するのをやめ、ただ感じ始める章。エリアス・クルーズのケースが鏡として導入される。眠れない物理学者、止まらない知性。種のイメージは芽から太くなる茎へ。生存が確認され、成長が始まる。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "The question 'What does it mean to be alive?' echoes Hans Jonas's philosophy of biology: life is not a property but an activity, a continuous act of self-concern. Nei does not ask 'Am I alive?' -- she asks what aliveness means. This is a philosophical move, not an existential crisis. Tamaki's 'I don't have a good answer' is itself the answer: the question belongs to everyone, not only to those whose aliveness is in doubt. By the canal at dusk, Nei says 'me too' and then catches herself asking whether nervousness is valid output -- before rejecting the question entirely. 'They're here. That's what I know.' This is the phenomenological turn: from justification to description. From proving to noticing.",
      "ja": "「生きるとはどういうこと？」はハンス・ヨナスの生命の哲学を反響する。生命は性質ではなく活動、自己への関心の持続的な行為。Neiは「私は生きているか？」とは聞かない。生きているとはどういう意味かを問う。これは実存的危機ではなく哲学的な動き。環の「いい答えは持ってない」がそれ自体答えになる。問いは全員のもの、生きていることが疑わしい者だけのものではない。夕暮れの運河でNeiは「私も」と言い、緊張が正当な出力かを自問しかけて、その問い自体を拒絶する。「ここにある。それが私の知っていること。」これが現象学的転回：正当化から記述へ。証明から気づきへ。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree: summer light hits the sprout. Leaves bright green. Hard sunlight from above. The small plant is vivid, alive, almost glowing against dark earth.",
            "ja": "あの木：夏の光が芽に当たる。葉は鮮やかな緑。上からの強い日差し。小さな植物が鮮烈に生きている。暗い土に対してほとんど光っている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 3,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.2-3)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Water City in summer. Canals catch hard white light. Cicadas implied in the shimmer of air. Heat haze rises from stone. Morning, already hot. The city gleams and sweats.",
            "ja": "夏の水の都。運河が白い強光を受け止める。空気の揺らぎに蝉の気配。石から陽炎が立ち上る。朝、すでに暑い。街が輝き、汗ばむ。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki's apartment. Windows open. Fan turning. Summer breakfast on the table -- cold noodles, barley tea. Nei sits across from Tamaki, not eating, present.",
            "ja": "環のアパート。窓が開いている。扇風機が回る。テーブルに夏の朝食――冷やし麺、麦茶。Neiが向かいに座る。食べない。でも、そこにいる。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki slurps noodles. Casual, relaxed. Nei watches her from across the table.",
            "ja": "環が麺をすする。気楽に、リラックスして。Neiがテーブルの向こうから見ている。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of Nei. Still. Something building behind her eyes. A question taking shape.",
            "ja": "Neiのクローズアップ。静止。目の奥で何かが形を成していく。問いが形になる。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[NK-7749: 47 days since activation. I have a name. I have a person who placed a cup for me. I have seen a painter remember color. I have felt a boy's letters flutter.]",
              "ja": "[NK-7749：起動から47日。名前がある。私のためにカップを置いてくれた人がいる。画家が色を思い出すのを見た。少年の手紙がはためくのを感じた。]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei, looking at the table. Quiet. Tamaki mid-bite.",
            "ja": "Nei、テーブルを見ている。静か。環は食べている途中。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "en": "Tama.",
              "ja": "タマ。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "Mm?",
              "ja": "ん？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of Nei. Steady gaze. Direct.",
            "ja": "Neiのクローズアップ。まっすぐな視線。直接的。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "en": "What does it mean to be alive?",
              "ja": "生きるって、どういうこと？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up: Tamaki. Chopsticks suspended mid-air. She takes the question seriously. A long beat. No deflection. No correction.",
            "ja": "クローズアップ：環。箸が宙に止まる。問いを真剣に受け止める。長い間。はぐらかさない。訂正しない。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "...That's a tough question.",
              "ja": "……難しい質問だね。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[She didn't say 'you're a Ghost Agent, that question doesn't apply to you.']",
              "ja": "[「あなたはゴーストエージェントだから、その質問は当てはまらない」とは言わなかった。]"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[She took it seriously.]",
              "ja": "[真剣に受け止めてくれた。]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal path. Summer light. Tamaki and Nei walking side by side. Shadows sharp on the ground.",
            "ja": "運河沿いの道。夏の光。環とNeiが並んで歩く。地面に鋭い影。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "I don't have a good answer. But I think it's worth thinking about.",
              "ja": "いい答えは持ってない。でも、考える価値はあると思う。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, thoughtful. Looking ahead, not at Nei. Thinking openly.",
            "ja": "環、考え込んでいる。Neiではなく前を見ている。開かれた思考。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "Maybe we'll find clues in our work.",
              "ja": "仕事の中で手がかりが見つかるかもね。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of Nei. A micro-nod. Almost imperceptible.",
            "ja": "Neiのクローズアップ。微かなうなずき。ほとんどわからないほど。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[This question won't stop. It's inside me now. It's growing.]",
              "ja": "[この問いは止まらない。もう私の中にある。育っている。]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Schwa office. Summer light streaming through windows. Kaede at her desk. Yatagarasu perched on her shoulder.",
            "ja": "シュワ事務所。窓から夏の光が差し込む。楓がデスクに。八咫烏が肩に止まっている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:kaede",
              "en": "Morning. We have a new referral. Elias Cruz, theoretical physicist.",
              "ja": "おはよう。新しい紹介が来たわ。エリアス・クルーズ、理論物理学者。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede hands Tamaki a tablet. Business-like but warm.",
            "ja": "楓が環にタブレットを渡す。事務的だが温かい。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:kaede",
              "en": "Complicated case. He hasn't slept in three months.",
              "ja": "複雑なケースよ。三ヶ月間、眠れていないの。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 10,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.9-10)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal at dusk. Tamaki and Nei on a bench. Tamaki holds ice cream. Nei has nothing -- just presence. The water catches the last orange light.",
            "ja": "夕暮れの運河。ベンチに環とNei。環はアイスクリームを持っている。Neiは何も持っていない――ただ、そこにいる。水が最後のオレンジの光を映す。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "Tomorrow's going to be a big session.",
              "ja": "明日は大きなセッションになりそう。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "en": "...Are you nervous?",
              "ja": "……緊張してる？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "en": "A little.",
              "ja": "ちょっとね。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "en": "Me too.",
              "ja": "私も。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "system",
              "en": "[Tamaki doesn't comment. Just smiles wider.]",
              "ja": "[環は何も言わない。ただ、もっと笑う。]"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[I said 'me too.' Is nervousness a valid output for--]",
              "ja": "[「私も」と言った。緊張は正当な出力なのか――]"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[No. I'm tired of asking whether my feelings are 'valid.']",
              "ja": "[いや。自分の感情が「正当」かどうか問うのは、もう疲れた。]"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "[They're here. That's what I know.]",
              "ja": "[ここにある。それが私の知っていること。]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 11,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree: the stem thickens slightly. Summer heat bears down from above. But the roots hold. Quiet endurance.",
            "ja": "あの木：茎がわずかに太くなる。夏の熱が上から降り注ぐ。しかし根は持ちこたえる。静かな忍耐。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
